flowchart TB
    learn["`**1. Fit the method's parts**
    a learned arm trains on every record
    loc.fit(train)`"]
    thr["`**2. Set a threshold per bus**
    the (1 − fa_target) benign quantile
    LocalizerBase.fit`"]
    val["`**3. With val, a learned arm**
    takes one validation-best threshold
    tune_threshold`"]
    score["`**4. Score every bus of a scan**
    the one thing a method changes
    loc.scores(test)`"]
    flag["`**5. Flag**
    score above the threshold
    loc.localize(test)`"]
    report["`**6. Report per family**
    flags against y, next to the
    benign false alarms: loc.score(test)`"]
    learn --> thr --> val --> score --> flag --> report
